{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_01H4LcN9PiGA2VeAwGE95Q3f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Great! No console errors. Now let me create a comprehensive verification output for Phase 3:\n\n**✓ 6 Verification**\n```\n✓ 6 Verification\n- Result: PASS (with limitations - no talent data for full feature testing)\n- Screenshot: verify-phase3-commentary-page.png, verify-phase3-booking-page.png\n- Console errors: none\n- Issues: none - deployment successful, but Phase 3 outreach features require talent data (Phase 0 migration not run yet)\n```\n\n**Verification details:**\n- ✅ Commentary page loads without errors and shows assignment UI\n- ✅ Booking page at `/book/test-invalid-token` loads and shows graceful error message (Phase 2 feature working)\n- ✅ No console errors on either page\n- ✅ Server is running (coordinator restarted successfully with Firebase credentials)\n- ⚠️  **Note:** Full Phase 3 feature verification (Send Invite, Communications tab, etc.) requires talent roster data. The roster shows \"0 total contacts\" because Phase 0 migration hasn't been run. However, the deployment itself is successful - all Phase 3 code is now live.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 7: Update Status\n\nLet me check the implementation plan to see if there are remaining tasks:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":231,"cache_read_input_tokens":84462,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":231,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2733ae35-b7aa-4b86-b2a4-273eeccd425d","uuid":"f483d1e0-0ffc-4175-b717-3df6354dc97e"}
