Talent-CRM/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM-2026-03-10.md:95:- As a coordinator, I go to `/talent/discover`, select a school, and click \"Find Candidates.\" The app pulls the RTN alumni roster for that school.\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM-2026-03-10.md:98:- As a coordinator, I click \"Add to Roster\" on a promising candidate. They're added with status `need-info` (or `has-contact` if Claude found an email).\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM-2026-03-10.md:99:- As a coordinator, if I run discovery on a school I've already run, the app recognizes existing records and shows \"already in roster\" on those cards.\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM-2026-03-10.md:103:- [ ] Clicking \"Find Candidates\" fetches alumni data for the selected school and returns candidate cards\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM-2026-03-10.md:105:- [ ] \"Add to Roster\" creates a `talentRoster/` entry with status `need-info` or `has-contact`\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM-2026-03-10.md:106:- [ ] Re-running discovery for the same school shows \"already in roster\" badge on existing records (no duplicates)\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM-2026-03-10.md:132:- [ ] Submitting the survey writes to `talentRoster/{talentId}` (matched by email) or creates a pending entry\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:5:> **Phase 1 (Talent Roster UI) is already complete.** This plan covers Phases 0, 2, 3, 4, 5.\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:47:// Writes to Firebase: talentRoster/{talentId}\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:67:**talentId format:** Generate as sanitized lowercase-dashed name: `name.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g, '-')`. If a collision is detected (same key, different email), append `-2`, `-3` etc. This format is consistent with how other roster entries reference talent across phases.\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:69:**Idempotency:** Before writing each record, check `talentRoster/{talentId}`. If it exists (match by email), UPDATE (merge) rather than overwrite. Log \"enriched\" for updates, \"created\" for new records.\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:120:- [ ] Live run creates records in Firebase `talentRoster/`\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:154://   talentRoster/{talentId}        → { name }\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:162://     For each selected compId: talentRoster/{talentId}/interested/{compId} = true\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:198:- Reads `bookingTokens/{token}`, `competitions/{compId}/config`, `talentRoster/{talentId}` on load\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:203:- On \"No\": queries `competitions/` from Firebase, filters meetDate > now, shows next 5 as checkboxes; submit writes `talentRoster/{talentId}/interested/{compId} = true` for each checked\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:246:// Writes parsed hints to talentRoster/{talentId}.parsedAvailability = { ... }\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:277:4. In the talent search panel (right side), show an \"Interested\" badge (green pill: \"Interested ✓\") next to any talent whose `talentRoster/{id}.interested` array contains the current `compId`\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:307:**Issue:** Firebase security rules do not allow public read access to `bookingTokens/` and `talentRoster/` paths.\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:319:    \"talentRoster\": {\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:423://   talentRoster/{talentId}/communicationLog/{pushKey} = { type, sentAt, note }\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:523:// discoverAlumni(schoolName) → Promise<CandidateCard[]>\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:525:// Step 1: Fetch RTN alumni roster page for the school\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:526://   URL pattern: https://www.rtnathletics.com/teams/{slug}/roster (research correct URL)\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:530://   CRITICAL: N+1 calls (one per athlete) = 50-300 seconds for a typical roster → HTTP timeout.\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:549:// Dedup check: compare against talentRoster in Firebase by name fuzzy match\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:550:// Mark alreadyInRoster: true if found\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:567:// Calls talentDiscoveryService.discoverAlumni(schoolName)\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:572:// Creates talentRoster entry:\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:574://   discoveredFrom: 'rtn-alumni'\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:592:5. Each card: \"Add to Roster\" button (calls `/api/talent/discover/add`) and \"Already in Roster\" badge if `alreadyInRoster`\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:678:**Write approach (definitive):** Write to `surveyResponses/{year}/{pushKey}`, NOT directly to `talentRoster/`. Opening `talentRoster/` to unauthenticated writes would allow anyone to corrupt talent profiles. The `surveyResponses/` path is append-only by unauthenticated users.\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md:708:NOTE: `surveyAvailability` is a keyed object — Task 5.3's filter reads from `talentRoster` (after merge), not directly from `surveyResponses`. The Settings page CSV import (Task 5.6) is also used to merge survey responses into `talentRoster` by email after the season.\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/Official Virtius Remote Commentary 2026 (Responses) - Form Responses 1 (6).csv:32:[Omitted long matching line]\ndocs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/Official Virtius Remote Commentary 2026 (Responses) - Form Responses 1 (6).csv:57:[Omitt