{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_015AcCiKKH5sBesGEwsv2p2X","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Task 4.1 is now complete.\n\n**Output:**\n```\n✓ 3.1 Implementation Complete\n- Changes made: Created talentDiscoveryService.js with discoverAlumni() function that:\n  - Attempts to fetch alumni roster from RTN (with fallback error handling since RTN doesn't have public alumni rosters)\n  - Batches ALL candidates into ONE Claude API call (avoiding N+1 timeout issue)\n  - Returns null for social links (per task requirements)\n  - Includes fuzzy name matching dedup check against existing talentRoster\n  - Returns CandidateCard array with score, explanation, and alreadyInRoster flag\n- Files modified: server/lib/talentDiscoveryService.js (new), docs/PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM/implementation-plan.md\n```\n\n```\n✓ 4.2 Committed\n- Commit message: PRD-Commentary-Talent-CRM: Create talent discovery service (Task 4.1)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Phase 5: Deploy (Skip for code tasks)\n\nThis is a CODE task (Task 4.1), so deployment is NOT needed until the deploy task (Task 4-D.1). Skipping to Phase 7.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 7: Update Status\n\nLet me check the implementation plan to see the remaining tasks:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":456,"cache_read_input_tokens":79072,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":456,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b312285a-8916-4420-ab2c-61d55d52cba8","uuid":"660ed896-fe88-4abb-b9f5-90ae43faa88f"}
